How to run OpenCode or mini-swe-agent inside the task sandbox for training: the adapter, a model
server the sandbox can reach (harbor_model_base_url, the per-sandbox chisel tunnel), token capture at
the model endpoint, sampling_overrides; tables of the OpenCodeNemoGym options and the model_tunnel
keys. TOC entries for it and for Failure classes.

